Rule 2 (dtype requirement is independent of name)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : str} |= if v_2 = "none" then dtype_(v_1) = 6 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 7 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 8 else dtype_(v_1) = 6 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 7 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 8
>>
Rule 3 (tensor dimensions are non-negative)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 4 (x must not be bool or complex)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≠ 0 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≠ 9 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≠ 10
